WEBVTT

01:35.950 --> 01:40.800
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.509 --> 01:44.030
[Episode 12]

01:44.200 --> 01:45.590
Such rash actions

01:45.680 --> 01:47.000
harm royal dignity.

01:47.120 --> 01:49.229
This matter must be strictly investigated,

01:49.229 --> 01:51.270
or the people will not accept it,

01:51.560 --> 01:53.220
nor will the court officials.

01:53.920 --> 01:54.840
Actually,

01:55.680 --> 01:58.430
Prime Minister Zhuang's argument
is not without logic.

01:58.430 --> 02:00.670
You are a bit too bold.

02:00.710 --> 02:02.680
Even if you've guessed my intentions

02:02.680 --> 02:04.050
and acted decisively,

02:04.200 --> 02:05.230
couldn't you have

02:05.230 --> 02:07.080
consulted with me beforehand?

02:07.430 --> 02:09.310
Since it's all for the sake of
the kingdom,

02:09.310 --> 02:09.870
I...

02:10.840 --> 02:12.630
can hardly rebuke you.

02:13.610 --> 02:15.310
Mr. Ma, a reply from Jinxiu.

02:17.310 --> 02:18.170
You may go.

02:20.680 --> 02:21.700
Your Majesty,

02:21.870 --> 02:23.800
the Emperor of Jinxiu has replied.

02:50.590 --> 02:52.550
To the Emperor of Susha,

02:52.579 --> 02:55.030
the Prince of Zhennan
is of noble Jinxiu lineage,

02:55.030 --> 02:56.690
with unparalleled status

02:56.750 --> 02:58.490
and impeccable character.

02:58.560 --> 03:00.560
Your Majesty has shown great discernment,

03:00.560 --> 03:03.000
and I shall not
let this precious gem be tarnished.

03:03.000 --> 03:05.030
The Prince of Zhennan's marriage
to your princess

03:05.030 --> 03:06.800
will surely become a timeless tale.

03:06.800 --> 03:09.190
If we can resolve
military conflicts through this,

03:09.190 --> 03:11.580
the princess and her husband
will have rendered great service.

03:11.580 --> 03:13.150
I will be greatly comforted.

03:13.150 --> 03:15.590
Enclosed are
Jinxiu's royal genealogy records

03:15.590 --> 03:18.400
and the prince's birth date
as engagement gifts.

03:18.430 --> 03:20.050
May we maintain good relations

03:20.050 --> 03:21.750
and harmony
between our families and kingdoms.

03:21.750 --> 03:23.280
Regarding the matter
of marrying into your family,

03:23.280 --> 03:25.140
I gladly give my blessing.

03:35.630 --> 03:38.620
Your Majesty, what does this mean?

03:39.030 --> 03:40.290
Don't you understand?

03:41.150 --> 03:42.350
Make him understand.

03:43.079 --> 03:44.920
"Regarding the matter
of marrying into your family,

03:44.920 --> 03:46.770
I gladly give my blessing."

03:48.050 --> 03:51.020
Congratulations, Your Majesty,
on gaining a son-in-law!

03:51.020 --> 03:54.550
May auspicious cranes and dragons fly
with heaven's blessing!

03:55.400 --> 03:59.260
-Congratulations, Your Majesty!
-Congratulations, Your Majesty!

04:01.750 --> 04:03.510
Congratulations, Your Majesty,

04:03.510 --> 04:04.910
on gaining a son-in-law.

04:05.180 --> 04:06.960
May auspicious cranes and dragons fly

04:06.960 --> 04:08.700
with heaven's blessing.

04:39.560 --> 04:40.420
Your Highness!

04:40.690 --> 04:42.020
We cannot agree to this.

04:43.320 --> 04:44.180
Your Highness,

04:44.450 --> 04:46.110
this is all Feng Suige's plot.

04:46.240 --> 04:49.170
We absolutely cannot agree to
the matrilocal marriage.

04:49.170 --> 04:50.520
How did you learn about this?

04:50.520 --> 04:52.180
Everyone is talking about it.

04:52.240 --> 04:53.170
At the inn,

04:53.270 --> 04:55.330
even the coachmen and servants know.

04:55.750 --> 04:58.150
The news shouldn't have spread so quickly.

04:58.190 --> 04:59.310
It must be Feng Suige

04:59.310 --> 05:01.160
who deliberately leaked the information.

05:01.160 --> 05:03.120
He wants to publicly humiliate
His Highness

05:03.120 --> 05:04.380
and humiliate Jinxiu.

05:04.510 --> 05:05.020
I can't stand

05:05.020 --> 05:06.390
this humiliation anymore!

05:06.390 --> 05:07.950
I'll pack our things and we'll leave.

05:07.950 --> 05:08.650
Leave?

05:08.800 --> 05:09.480
Where to?

05:09.510 --> 05:10.720
Back to Pingling City.

05:10.720 --> 05:11.680
If we don't leave tonight,

05:11.680 --> 05:12.410
by tomorrow, the news

05:12.410 --> 05:13.540
will spread throughout Yujing City,

05:13.540 --> 05:14.750
and then we'll never be able to return.

05:14.750 --> 05:16.010
It's already too late.

05:17.460 --> 05:19.260
The Emperor has already agreed.

05:19.610 --> 05:20.940
If I leave now,

05:21.260 --> 05:22.310
won't I become the one who ruins

05:22.310 --> 05:23.900
the marriage alliance
between the kingdoms?

05:23.900 --> 05:26.300
If Your Highness stays in Susha long-term,

05:26.390 --> 05:28.300
the Emperor can justifiably

05:28.360 --> 05:30.160
take back control of Pingling City.

05:30.160 --> 05:31.360
Why wouldn't he do so?

05:31.800 --> 05:33.060
What should we do then?

05:33.840 --> 05:36.120
Feng Suige's strategy is an open trap.

05:36.840 --> 05:38.350
There's no way to counter this.

05:38.350 --> 05:40.350
He's anticipated every situation.

05:40.400 --> 05:41.250
He knows

05:41.650 --> 05:42.270
that Your Highness

05:42.270 --> 05:44.070
has no choice but to stay in Susha

05:44.720 --> 05:45.650
as a son-in-law.

05:46.750 --> 05:47.870
You can't agree to this, Your Highness.

05:47.870 --> 05:49.130
You absolutely can't.

05:49.700 --> 05:50.860
If we leave tonight,

05:51.200 --> 05:52.230
what about rescuing Yixiao?

05:52.230 --> 05:52.960
What I mean is

05:53.000 --> 05:54.159
we should leave with Yixiao together.

05:54.159 --> 05:54.770
Enough.

05:55.790 --> 05:58.650
Things have come to this point.
We can't fight fate.

06:00.600 --> 06:03.200
This marriage
was bound to happen eventually.

06:06.600 --> 06:08.170
Moreover, our marriage

06:08.640 --> 06:10.440
is greatly important to Jinxiu.

06:10.560 --> 06:12.980
Becoming a son-in-law
doesn't just humiliate me.

06:12.980 --> 06:15.180
It also affects the Emperor's dignity.

06:15.740 --> 06:17.160
I'll keep this in mind.

06:18.340 --> 06:19.730
He'll pay for it later.

06:22.680 --> 06:23.540
Your Highness,

06:23.640 --> 06:25.430
what if we let Feng Suige believe

06:25.430 --> 06:27.080
that we're leaving

06:27.340 --> 06:28.270
Yujing tonight?

06:29.080 --> 06:30.190
Why are you bringing him up?

06:30.190 --> 06:32.590
He must be secretly celebrating right now.

06:32.780 --> 06:34.260
If I were Feng Suige,

06:34.740 --> 06:36.750
I would keep Yixiao under house arrest.

06:36.750 --> 06:37.530
Because if someday

06:37.530 --> 06:38.800
we decided to go down fighting

06:38.800 --> 06:39.810
and leave Yujing,

06:41.230 --> 06:42.900
we might take Yixiao with us.

06:43.680 --> 06:45.050
Yixiao staying at Zhengnian Hall

06:45.050 --> 06:46.310
is ultimately unsafe.

06:46.430 --> 06:47.070
She could fall into

06:47.070 --> 06:49.130
Feng Suige's hands again at any time.

06:50.159 --> 06:50.750
Here.

06:51.340 --> 06:52.050
You two,

06:52.490 --> 06:54.260
go to Zhengnian Hall now
and stay with her.

06:54.260 --> 06:55.500
The current situation is sensitive.

06:55.500 --> 06:56.580
I must stay here

06:56.870 --> 06:59.510
to avoid giving others grounds
for criticism in the future.

06:59.510 --> 07:00.270
-Yes.
-Yes.

07:17.790 --> 07:19.690
(Rice Cake)

07:20.470 --> 07:21.330
Your Highness.

07:21.470 --> 07:22.830
All the people around have left?

07:22.830 --> 07:23.390
Yes.

07:23.630 --> 07:24.870
The enemies won't be alerted.

07:24.870 --> 07:25.870
But Your Highness,

07:25.870 --> 07:26.950
how can you be certain

07:26.950 --> 07:27.430
that Xia Jingshi

07:27.430 --> 07:28.850
will definitely act tonight?

07:28.850 --> 07:31.010
[Inn]

07:29.920 --> 07:32.360
Jinxiu's messenger
just entered the city today

07:32.360 --> 07:33.680
and Xia Jingshi has already left
the pharmacy

07:33.680 --> 07:35.010
and returned to the inn.

07:35.360 --> 07:36.720
I believe he already knows about

07:36.720 --> 07:38.600
the reply from the Emperor of Jinxiu.

07:38.600 --> 07:39.580
With his power alone,

07:39.580 --> 07:41.310
he can't change the situation.

07:41.400 --> 07:42.920
If he wants to escape from Susha,

07:42.920 --> 07:44.580
he must have someone help him.

07:45.120 --> 07:47.980
And he will definitely come
to find him personally.

07:57.740 --> 08:00.800
[Zhengnian Hall]

08:25.920 --> 08:26.480
Xueying,

08:26.550 --> 08:27.810
there's sleeping gas!

08:40.600 --> 08:41.150
Sister!

08:43.980 --> 08:45.150
Protect the children!

08:45.150 --> 08:45.680
Alright.

08:53.440 --> 08:54.010
Yixiao!

09:00.510 --> 09:02.440
Sister, the children are all safe.

09:03.030 --> 09:03.630
After him!

09:31.870 --> 09:32.390
Sir.

09:35.270 --> 09:36.130
Please come in.

09:43.360 --> 09:44.120
Who exactly

09:44.150 --> 09:45.510
is Xia Jingshi meeting?

09:46.240 --> 09:47.040
In my opinion,

09:47.840 --> 09:50.100
it's most likely Prime Minister Zhuang.

09:50.440 --> 09:51.390
Before today,

09:51.930 --> 09:52.840
I also thought

09:52.870 --> 09:54.240
this person would be
Prime Minister Zhuang.

09:54.240 --> 09:54.750
But Fu Yixiao

09:54.750 --> 09:56.220
gave me a new idea.

09:57.030 --> 09:58.790
After the Battle of Pingling, this person

09:58.790 --> 09:59.720
disguised as a merchant

09:59.720 --> 10:00.870
and sneaked into Jinxiu's military camp

10:00.870 --> 10:02.270
to meet secretly with Xia Jingshi.

10:02.270 --> 10:04.150
Then it couldn't possibly be
Prime Minister Zhuang

10:04.150 --> 10:05.440
but someone else.

10:06.080 --> 10:07.270
We can't worry about all that now.

10:07.270 --> 10:08.240
We must find this person

10:08.240 --> 10:08.840
today.

10:08.870 --> 10:09.730
Your Highness!

10:13.270 --> 10:14.720
There's trouble at the pharmacy.

10:14.720 --> 10:15.510
The pharmacy is in trouble,

10:15.510 --> 10:16.270
yet you have time to come here?

10:16.270 --> 10:17.320
Why aren't you helping?

10:17.320 --> 10:18.380
I told Gu Yu to come

10:18.550 --> 10:19.840
and report everything
to His Highness first.

10:19.840 --> 10:20.440
Lu Ke,

10:20.960 --> 10:22.490
keep watching Xia Jingshi.

10:22.510 --> 10:23.060
Yun Fang,

10:23.270 --> 10:25.200
send men to surround the teahouse.

10:25.320 --> 10:26.380
Gu Yu, come with me.

10:26.790 --> 10:27.320
Let's go.

10:36.550 --> 10:37.810
Split up and chase him!

10:38.240 --> 10:39.100
Go help Yixiao!

10:39.150 --> 10:39.790
You be careful.

10:39.790 --> 10:40.240
Hurry!

10:56.440 --> 10:57.320
Who are you?

10:57.550 --> 10:59.000
Why do you want to kill Yixiao?

10:59.000 --> 11:01.000
Seems I won't be able to leave today.

12:02.760 --> 12:03.390
Why would someone

12:03.390 --> 12:04.320
in Yujing City want to harm you?

12:04.320 --> 12:05.010
How would I know?

12:05.010 --> 12:05.870
Are you hiding something

12:05.870 --> 12:06.770
from us?

12:09.800 --> 12:12.130
It's you all
who are hiding things from me.

12:12.390 --> 12:13.450
Explain yourself.

12:14.030 --> 12:15.440
What have we hidden from you?

12:15.440 --> 12:16.500
You know very well.

12:19.360 --> 12:20.960
I won't argue with you today.

12:21.120 --> 12:22.400
Let's chase the assassin first.

12:22.400 --> 12:23.020
Yixiao!

12:48.160 --> 12:49.150
Why?

12:49.950 --> 12:50.700
Yixiao,

12:51.870 --> 12:52.470
I'm sorry.

12:54.030 --> 12:55.590
Why are you doing this to me?

12:56.120 --> 12:56.840
We are

12:56.840 --> 12:59.300
brothers who faced
life and death together!

12:59.600 --> 13:00.120
Yixiao,

13:02.000 --> 13:02.930
I have no choice.

13:03.540 --> 13:04.440
For Jinxiu,

13:05.030 --> 13:06.240
I have no choice!

13:07.530 --> 13:08.990
I've suspected anyone.

13:09.510 --> 13:11.240
How could it possibly be you?

13:12.490 --> 13:14.020
Why are you doing this to me?

13:14.280 --> 13:15.850
Why would you do this?

13:17.320 --> 13:18.230
Our lives

13:19.360 --> 13:21.620
have long ceased to belong to ourselves.

13:22.870 --> 13:23.480
Yixiao.

13:24.510 --> 13:25.440
You go ahead.

13:26.750 --> 13:28.410
When I finish what I need to do,

13:28.670 --> 13:30.400
I'll join you in the afterlife.

13:31.240 --> 13:32.040
What I owe you,

13:32.730 --> 13:34.260
I'll repay in the next life.

13:50.260 --> 13:51.340
Take this.

13:52.560 --> 13:53.360
What is this?

13:55.320 --> 13:57.700
This is my mercy as a prince.

14:11.730 --> 14:13.460
So you were prepared all along.

14:14.230 --> 14:15.460
I was right.

14:16.320 --> 14:17.150
You've already remembered

14:17.150 --> 14:18.350
who wants to kill you.

14:22.260 --> 14:24.270
Xia Jingshi shot me down with an arrow,

14:24.270 --> 14:25.120
simply because I heard

14:25.120 --> 14:26.200
what I shouldn't have heard.

14:26.200 --> 14:26.840
What exactly happened

14:26.840 --> 14:27.910
in that tent that day?

14:27.910 --> 14:29.390
And who was that so-called merchant?

14:29.390 --> 14:31.030
What are you really planning?

14:31.030 --> 14:32.230
All you need to know is

14:32.550 --> 14:33.980
everything is for Jinxiu!

14:33.980 --> 14:34.890
Am I not

14:34.920 --> 14:35.880
a citizen of Jinxiu too?

14:35.880 --> 14:37.080
Am I not your brother?

14:37.120 --> 14:37.890
Would I really

14:37.890 --> 14:39.440
betray Jinxiu?

14:40.080 --> 14:40.670
I've risked my life

14:40.670 --> 14:42.210
for Jinxiu all these years.

14:42.300 --> 14:43.680
What plan could possibly

14:43.680 --> 14:45.360
make you so determined to kill me?

14:45.360 --> 14:46.490
Stop asking!

15:36.960 --> 15:38.160
Everything I've done

15:38.790 --> 15:39.910
was for Jinxiu,

15:40.870 --> 15:41.870
for His Highness!

16:16.030 --> 16:16.950
I, Ning Fei...

16:17.510 --> 16:18.420
I, Fu Yixiao...

16:18.680 --> 16:19.780
I, Xiao Weiran...

16:20.240 --> 16:21.640
With tea in place of wine,

16:21.650 --> 16:23.760
hereby become sworn brothers.

16:28.030 --> 16:30.750
We may not have been born
on the same day...

16:32.680 --> 16:35.620
But we vow to die on the same day.

18:25.740 --> 18:26.350
Go!

18:50.200 --> 18:51.200
She told you to go.

18:52.720 --> 18:54.120
Did I say you could leave?

19:11.910 --> 19:12.590
You know

19:12.590 --> 19:14.240
I never agreed to this marriage alliance.

19:14.240 --> 19:16.300
Jinxiu Military Advisor Xiao Weiran

19:16.350 --> 19:18.330
deliberately attempted to harm my family.

19:18.330 --> 19:19.560
I can't let

19:19.640 --> 19:21.570
such a good opportunity slip away.

19:22.070 --> 19:23.270
Will you surrender

19:23.270 --> 19:24.760
or fight to the death?

19:26.310 --> 19:27.480
Your choice.

19:41.610 --> 19:42.870
Come, this way please.

19:45.400 --> 19:46.030
Where's the customer

19:46.030 --> 19:47.350
who just went upstairs?

19:47.350 --> 19:48.210
He's upstairs.

19:51.240 --> 19:51.750
Hey.

20:19.160 --> 20:19.780
Hurry!

20:23.880 --> 20:24.600
Where is he?

20:25.240 --> 20:26.350
Speak up! Where is he?

20:26.350 --> 20:28.070
Speak? He escaped through the back door.

20:28.070 --> 20:28.780
Where is he?

20:31.000 --> 20:33.540
[Hongfu Pewterware]

20:37.720 --> 20:38.580
Your Highness,

20:38.720 --> 20:39.590
please punish me.

20:39.590 --> 20:40.640
I lost him.

20:47.220 --> 20:47.940
Your Highness,

20:47.940 --> 20:48.790
when I went in,

20:48.830 --> 20:49.640
I saw Xia Jingshi

20:49.640 --> 20:50.590
going upstairs.

21:10.800 --> 21:12.660
He couldn't have done this alone.

21:12.750 --> 21:13.960
He must have had help.

21:14.680 --> 21:15.650
Do you mean

21:15.830 --> 21:17.360
someone helped him escape?

21:17.790 --> 21:19.680
Otherwise, how would a prince from Jinxiu

21:19.680 --> 21:21.290
know which teahouse
in Susha's Yujing Capital

21:21.290 --> 21:22.760
has a back door?

21:22.960 --> 21:24.270
Your Highness, don't worry.

21:24.270 --> 21:25.200
I'll lead men to search right away.

21:25.200 --> 21:26.090
We'll definitely catch him.

21:26.090 --> 21:26.960
No need to search.

21:26.960 --> 21:28.580
Before you even begin,

21:28.720 --> 21:30.000
he probably will have already

21:30.000 --> 21:31.590
returned to the inn unscathed.

21:31.590 --> 21:32.110
However, tonight

21:32.110 --> 21:33.840
wasn't completely fruitless.

21:33.950 --> 21:36.440
Just now, Xiao Weiran
tried to kill Fu Yixiao.

21:36.440 --> 21:38.270
The fox has shown its tail.

21:38.920 --> 21:39.980
Go interrogate him

21:40.160 --> 21:41.820
and deliver a message from me.

21:42.070 --> 21:42.510
Yes.

22:10.110 --> 22:11.200
Being so cautious,

22:12.070 --> 22:14.270
seems like you're afraid of Feng Suige.

22:15.730 --> 22:16.710
Shouldn't you be

22:17.200 --> 22:18.530
the one being cautious?

22:20.350 --> 22:22.010
I can't stay in Susha anymore.

22:22.400 --> 22:23.320
I must go back.

22:24.750 --> 22:25.830
After the wedding,

22:26.110 --> 22:26.900
I'll find a way

22:26.900 --> 22:28.300
to help you leave Yujing.

22:28.550 --> 22:29.270
However,

22:29.720 --> 22:31.780
what do you plan to do with that woman?

22:33.640 --> 22:34.900
She's lost her memory.

22:35.310 --> 22:36.510
She won't be a threat.

22:36.640 --> 22:38.300
Who can be certain about that?

22:38.440 --> 22:39.510
There's no guarantee

22:39.510 --> 22:41.240
she won't remember something.

22:42.000 --> 22:43.660
I've already killed her once.

22:44.070 --> 22:44.720
I will never

22:44.720 --> 22:46.020
kill her again.

22:47.200 --> 22:48.860
I'll bring her back to Jinxiu.

22:49.160 --> 22:49.640
Also,

22:50.350 --> 22:51.680
after your plan starts,

22:51.680 --> 22:53.640
the secret will no longer be a secret.

22:53.640 --> 22:54.240
Anyway,

22:54.820 --> 22:56.400
she can't die.

22:58.110 --> 22:58.970
Your Highness,

22:59.200 --> 23:00.130
are you certain?

23:01.650 --> 23:02.580
What do you mean?

23:03.030 --> 23:05.940
Xiao Weiran
failed to assassinate Fu Yixiao.

23:06.350 --> 23:07.400
He has now fallen

23:07.400 --> 23:08.800
into Feng Suige's hands.

23:09.070 --> 23:10.130
Let me remind you.

23:10.310 --> 23:12.590
If you don't want to be
trapped here forever,

23:12.590 --> 23:13.960
stay calm

23:14.200 --> 23:15.400
and don't act rashly.

23:16.000 --> 23:17.460
Don't sacrifice yourself

23:17.830 --> 23:19.490
for someone like Xiao Weiran.

23:30.080 --> 23:32.490
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

23:32.910 --> 23:35.890
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

23:36.470 --> 23:38.410
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

23:39.260 --> 23:42.490
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

23:43.000 --> 23:45.240
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

23:45.900 --> 23:48.910
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

23:49.530 --> 23:55.170
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

23:55.780 --> 23:57.510
What will you do to Xiao Weiran?

24:00.750 --> 24:01.930
I captured him.

24:02.270 --> 24:04.480
How I deal with him
is none of your business.

24:04.480 --> 24:05.880
Of course it concerns me.

24:06.550 --> 24:07.750
He is my brother.

24:08.440 --> 24:09.640
I wanted to let him go.

24:10.110 --> 24:11.440
Why did you capture him?

24:14.510 --> 24:15.770
Where is he being held?

24:16.310 --> 24:17.170
In the dungeon?

24:24.520 --> 24:26.220
Since he's in my custody,

24:26.580 --> 24:29.910
♪ The world is vast and far ♪

24:26.770 --> 24:28.090
let me handle this.

24:28.650 --> 24:29.850
I'm the one involved.

24:30.130 --> 24:31.660
I'm the one he wants to kill.

24:31.810 --> 24:33.240
Naturally, I'll take care of it.

24:33.240 --> 24:33.840
Let go.

24:33.290 --> 24:36.060
♪ Time is unbearable to endure ♪

24:34.720 --> 24:35.810
You should know

24:36.310 --> 24:37.640
you won't get any answers.

24:36.440 --> 24:39.540
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

24:39.970 --> 24:42.480
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

24:41.440 --> 24:42.990
Of course I know!

24:43.000 --> 24:45.680
♪ Even if devastation fills my eyes ♪

24:43.440 --> 24:45.060
Do you think I don't know?

24:45.440 --> 24:46.840
But he's my brother.

24:46.160 --> 24:48.870
♪ The shadows continue to sway ♪

24:46.910 --> 24:48.640
Can you understand how I feel?

24:49.210 --> 24:52.270
♪ The phoenix going against light ♪

24:49.440 --> 24:50.770
What if it were Yun Fang?

24:51.000 --> 24:52.020
If it were Yun Fang today,

24:52.020 --> 24:53.150
what would you do?

24:52.700 --> 24:55.440
♪ Has been looking for a thousand miles ♪

24:56.640 --> 24:58.440
I just want to personally ask him

24:59.240 --> 25:00.310
why he did this.

25:05.230 --> 25:08.150
♪ If nothing said, then nothing heard;
if no will, then no us♪

25:05.590 --> 25:06.850
He once told me

25:08.510 --> 25:09.070
that we were

25:08.530 --> 25:11.300
♪ The moon is clear yet heartless ♪

25:09.070 --> 25:11.530
brothers who faced
life and death together!

25:11.820 --> 25:14.450
♪ No love, no longing;
no meeting, no missing ♪

25:12.880 --> 25:13.440
Together,

25:13.440 --> 25:15.000
we crawled out from piles of corpses.

25:14.890 --> 25:17.310
♪ With high mountains and long roads,
a life adrift ♪

25:16.030 --> 25:17.170
We bled

25:17.720 --> 25:18.790
and killed together.

25:17.850 --> 25:20.510
♪ A life adrift ♪

25:20.160 --> 25:22.640
We're closer than family related by blood.

25:20.950 --> 25:23.960
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

25:23.680 --> 25:25.480
But I don't know why

25:24.480 --> 25:26.990
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

25:26.750 --> 25:28.110
and from when

25:27.510 --> 25:30.540
♪ Even if the wilderness is boundless ♪

25:29.590 --> 25:30.350
we became

25:30.400 --> 25:31.640
like this today.

25:31.020 --> 25:33.550
♪ We won't separate ♪

25:33.880 --> 25:36.920
♪ In the dark night, I look back ♪

25:37.360 --> 25:40.250
♪ Amid despair ♪

25:39.810 --> 25:40.480
Fu Yixiao.

25:40.780 --> 25:43.310
♪ A grain of incense, a tear,
an inch of ash ♪

25:41.240 --> 25:42.160
Listen to me.

25:42.750 --> 25:43.780
This is not your fault.

25:43.780 --> 25:46.670
♪ Gathered and parted, all for you ♪

25:44.550 --> 25:45.880
What he said might be right,

25:45.880 --> 25:47.210
but that was in the past.

25:47.240 --> 25:48.030
You are no longer

25:48.030 --> 25:49.440
the Fu Yixiao you once were.

25:49.440 --> 25:50.300
And Xiao Weiran

25:50.300 --> 25:53.100
♪ You and I silently recite ♪

25:50.310 --> 25:51.510
is nothing but a liar

25:51.510 --> 25:52.830
who means you harm.

25:53.790 --> 25:55.450
Why should you care about him?

25:56.820 --> 25:59.060
♪ This love will never perish ♪

25:58.790 --> 26:00.620
If you look at things from another angle,

26:00.620 --> 26:01.640
you're already luckier

26:01.640 --> 26:02.640
than most people.

26:03.120 --> 26:05.730
♪ I search for you, yet cannot find you ♪

26:03.270 --> 26:04.440
At least when those you trusted

26:04.440 --> 26:05.450
betrayed you,

26:06.080 --> 26:07.880
you've already forgotten them.

26:11.350 --> 26:12.350
Isn't that right?

26:17.160 --> 26:18.760
Are you trying to comfort me?

26:21.220 --> 26:22.260
Perhaps I am.

26:25.670 --> 26:27.670
Thank you for your good intentions.

26:28.440 --> 26:30.300
But your way of comforting people

26:30.520 --> 26:31.700
is truly terrible.

26:55.790 --> 26:57.030
But in everything I do,

26:57.030 --> 26:58.290
I always consider you.

27:00.470 --> 27:01.160
I will never

27:01.160 --> 27:03.240
let anyone hurt you again.

27:26.030 --> 27:27.030
The Three Heroes of Jinxiu

27:27.030 --> 27:28.590
really live up to their reputation.

27:28.590 --> 27:30.210
You even bear to kill your own.

27:30.210 --> 27:31.160
Tell me,

27:31.200 --> 27:33.510
if a human truly becomes
heartless and disloyal,

27:33.510 --> 27:35.710
how are they any different from beasts?

27:36.400 --> 27:37.800
The prince will punish me

27:38.000 --> 27:39.070
for what I've done.

27:40.110 --> 27:42.920
The marriage alliance
between our kingdoms is imminent.

27:42.920 --> 27:44.520
The prince will soon find out

27:44.960 --> 27:46.760
that you've imprisoned me here.

27:47.480 --> 27:48.280
Aren't you all

27:48.750 --> 27:50.880
afraid of ruining the bigger picture?

27:52.270 --> 27:55.130
Your life or death
won't affect the bigger picture.

27:56.750 --> 27:57.750
Jinxiu's undercover guards

27:57.750 --> 27:59.680
infiltrated Susha's Yujing City,

27:59.880 --> 28:01.240
hijacked and burned a merchant ship,

28:01.240 --> 28:03.700
and attempted to assassinate His Highness.

28:06.030 --> 28:06.680
We haven't

28:06.680 --> 28:08.680
even settled this debt with you yet.

28:12.110 --> 28:13.550
In such a short time,

28:13.570 --> 28:15.720
you managed to get an entire ship of oil.

28:15.720 --> 28:16.790
There must be someone

28:16.790 --> 28:18.850
in Yujing City secretly helping you.

28:21.480 --> 28:23.640
I don't understand
what you're talking about.

28:23.640 --> 28:25.400
It doesn't matter if you don't confess.

28:25.400 --> 28:26.700
We have plenty of time.

28:27.200 --> 28:28.950
Don't expect to

28:29.350 --> 28:30.810
get a single word out of me.

28:31.400 --> 28:32.600
We know you're tough.

28:32.830 --> 28:33.890
His Highness said,

28:34.240 --> 28:34.860
for you,

28:35.400 --> 28:37.270
it's imprisonment without trial,

28:37.270 --> 28:38.880
confinement without execution.

28:38.880 --> 28:40.010
What does that mean?

28:41.440 --> 28:42.880
What exactly do you mean?

28:49.400 --> 28:51.000
Did you say what I told you to?

28:51.920 --> 28:52.870
How did he react?

28:53.070 --> 28:54.400
It seems the ship burning incident

28:54.400 --> 28:56.200
is definitely connected to him.

28:57.400 --> 28:58.500
That's right.

28:58.790 --> 29:00.620
Besides Xia Jingshi,

29:00.880 --> 29:02.720
only he can mobilize
Jinxiu's undercover guards.

29:02.720 --> 29:03.580
Your Highness,

29:03.640 --> 29:05.240
the marriage alliance
is about to take place.

29:05.240 --> 29:06.510
Now that we've captured Xiao Weiran,

29:06.510 --> 29:07.310
won't Xia Jingshi

29:07.310 --> 29:07.960
make a fuss

29:07.960 --> 29:08.860
with this?

29:09.160 --> 29:11.240
Making a fuss
will only hinder the marriage alliance,

29:11.240 --> 29:12.920
which isn't what he wants to see.

29:12.920 --> 29:14.050
Then isn't he afraid

29:14.200 --> 29:15.750
Xiao Weiran might be forced to confess?

29:15.750 --> 29:17.750
He knows Xiao Weiran won't confess.

29:18.110 --> 29:20.370
And we don't need his confession anyway.

29:20.510 --> 29:22.110
Then I'm even more confused.

29:22.310 --> 29:23.200
Your Highness, you clearly know

29:23.200 --> 29:24.250
he won't say anything,

29:24.250 --> 29:26.450
yet you still keep him imprisoned here.

29:27.070 --> 29:27.880
Do you want to

29:28.750 --> 29:30.110
force him to commit suicide?

29:30.110 --> 29:32.110
Just because we can't get him to talk

29:32.350 --> 29:34.240
doesn't mean others can't.

30:00.420 --> 30:02.010
Why are you doing this to me?

30:03.000 --> 30:03.550
We are

30:03.570 --> 30:05.790
brothers who faced
life and death together!

30:05.790 --> 30:06.720
I, Xiao Weiran...

30:06.720 --> 30:07.550
I, Fu Yixiao...

30:07.550 --> 30:08.350
I, Ning Fei...

30:08.350 --> 30:10.480
From this day on, join the Zhennan Army

30:10.550 --> 30:12.680
and swear loyalty unto death
to His Highness!

30:12.680 --> 30:13.720
Kill!

30:55.780 --> 30:58.510
[Wutong Mansion]

30:57.260 --> 30:58.240
Feng Suige!

30:58.590 --> 31:00.250
Where is Yixiao? Where is she?

31:00.640 --> 31:01.480
She's safe.

31:03.960 --> 31:04.790
What about Weiran?

31:04.790 --> 31:06.050
Is he here with you too?

31:06.790 --> 31:08.330
He plotted to kill Yixiao,

31:08.440 --> 31:09.310
so I locked him up.

31:09.310 --> 31:10.590
Stop talking nonsense.

31:10.590 --> 31:11.880
I don't care what tricks you're playing.

31:11.880 --> 31:12.880
You must hand them

31:12.880 --> 31:13.810
over to me today.

31:13.960 --> 31:15.090
Otherwise, I'll...

31:17.310 --> 31:18.240
Otherwise what?

31:19.880 --> 31:21.440
I see that besides talking big,

31:21.440 --> 31:23.040
you only have brute strength

31:23.070 --> 31:24.830
and no other use.

31:25.160 --> 31:26.880
No wonder even your own brother

31:26.880 --> 31:28.670
manipulates you.

31:28.830 --> 31:29.960
What are you saying?

31:35.610 --> 31:36.810
You should recognize

31:37.310 --> 31:38.710
this waist token, right?

31:42.000 --> 31:43.200
How did you get this?

31:43.310 --> 31:44.310
This was found on

31:44.310 --> 31:46.110
an assassin's body in the forest

31:46.110 --> 31:48.040
where Fu Yixiao fell off the cliff.

31:50.960 --> 31:51.880
Assassin?

31:52.880 --> 31:53.880
After Fu Yixiao fell off the cliff,

31:53.880 --> 31:55.110
she was attacked by assassins.

31:55.110 --> 31:57.020
You didn't know?

31:57.350 --> 31:58.170
You're lying.

31:58.200 --> 31:59.720
Yixiao fell off the cliff by accident.

31:59.720 --> 32:00.870
Who told you that?

32:01.310 --> 32:02.550
Someone saw it with their own eyes

32:02.550 --> 32:03.680
that His Highness and Weiran...

32:03.680 --> 32:04.750
Why should I tell you?

32:04.750 --> 32:07.550
With her skills,
how could she accidentally fall?

32:08.240 --> 32:10.100
Perhaps she had too much to drink.

32:10.680 --> 32:12.020
I think Xia Jingshi

32:12.160 --> 32:13.350
keeps you around

32:13.370 --> 32:14.400
for entertainment.

32:14.400 --> 32:14.980
Hey!

32:15.070 --> 32:16.930
The wound on Fu Yixiao's shoulder

32:17.160 --> 32:18.480
was from an arrow shot within five steps

32:18.480 --> 32:19.240
of her.

32:19.260 --> 32:20.520
She was completely unprepared,

32:20.520 --> 32:21.440
which means the archer

32:21.440 --> 32:22.790
was someone she trusted.

32:22.790 --> 32:23.830
Later, I found her

32:23.850 --> 32:24.350
at Zhengnian Villa

32:24.350 --> 32:25.880
and brought her back to Yujing.

32:25.880 --> 32:27.200
Along the way, Jinxiu's undercover guards

32:27.200 --> 32:28.480
were waiting for an opportunity,

32:28.480 --> 32:29.350
and they knew

32:29.350 --> 32:31.000
they couldn't make a move in Yujing City.

32:31.000 --> 32:32.400
That's why they used those children

32:32.400 --> 32:34.210
to force her to show herself.

32:35.380 --> 32:37.510
Haven't you thought about any of this?

32:38.680 --> 32:39.790
This...

32:40.920 --> 32:42.730
And who can mobilize

32:43.510 --> 32:45.160
these Jinxiu underover guards?

32:45.160 --> 32:46.260
I don't need to tell you this.

32:46.260 --> 32:48.060
You should already know, right?

32:54.270 --> 32:55.140
Feng Suige,

32:55.240 --> 32:56.500
don't think that I'll believe you

32:56.500 --> 32:57.490
by playing these tricks.

32:57.490 --> 32:59.620
If you don't believe me, go ask Yixiao.

32:59.720 --> 33:00.480
I will.

33:04.050 --> 33:04.820
Yixiao!

33:06.200 --> 33:06.930
Yixiao!

33:08.910 --> 33:10.480
Yixiao, answer me!

33:11.590 --> 33:12.960
Yixiao, where are you?

33:14.160 --> 33:14.960
Yixiao!

33:18.090 --> 33:19.340
Yixiao!

33:22.640 --> 33:23.240
Yixiao!

33:23.750 --> 33:24.350
Yixiao.

33:24.960 --> 33:26.310
I'm glad you're alright.

33:26.310 --> 33:27.570
What's wrong, Yixiao?

33:28.480 --> 33:29.340
Say something.

33:29.750 --> 33:30.650
Yixiao.

33:30.960 --> 33:31.940
Feng Suige just told me

33:31.940 --> 33:33.350
that Weiran wanted to harm you.

33:33.350 --> 33:34.580
What exactly happened?

33:34.580 --> 33:35.870
You can't believe what Feng Suige says.

33:35.870 --> 33:38.270
He must be trying to
sow discord between us.

33:38.720 --> 33:40.200
Yixiao, you can't stay here.

33:40.200 --> 33:41.680
Let's go find His Highness.

33:41.680 --> 33:42.880
Are you done talking?

33:44.540 --> 33:45.940
If so, then go back.

34:02.680 --> 34:03.480
Yixiao!

34:04.350 --> 34:05.390
Impossible.

34:05.720 --> 34:06.820
Impossible!

34:07.830 --> 34:09.170
What Feng Suige said wasn't true.

34:09.170 --> 34:11.100
There must be a misunderstanding!

34:12.900 --> 34:13.550
Yixiao,

34:14.360 --> 34:16.219
I'll ask His Highness to clarify.

34:16.340 --> 34:18.670
I'll definitely
get to the bottom of this.

34:27.190 --> 34:29.630
Your Majesty, Xue Yan pays his respects.

34:30.540 --> 34:31.940
No need for formalities.

34:32.590 --> 34:33.480
These are the betrothal gifts

34:33.480 --> 34:34.989
prepared by our kingdom.

34:35.070 --> 34:36.920
Please review them, Your Majesty.

34:36.920 --> 34:39.350
[Gift List]

34:46.790 --> 34:47.679
[Two emerald tassel crowns]

34:47.710 --> 34:48.730
[Two pearl and jade crowns]

34:52.670 --> 34:53.810
Your emperor

34:53.960 --> 34:56.360
allowing the Prince of Zhennan
to stay in Susha

34:56.360 --> 34:59.230
shows sincere intention
to maintain peace between our nations.

34:59.230 --> 34:59.880
I will

35:00.110 --> 35:03.360
also do my utmost
to improve bilateral relations.

35:03.360 --> 35:05.440
From now on, Susha and Jinxiu

35:05.440 --> 35:06.980
will be brotherly kingdoms

35:07.110 --> 35:09.000
with no more war or conflict.

35:12.920 --> 35:14.230
Your Majesty's benevolence

35:14.230 --> 35:16.080
is a blessing for all people.

35:16.190 --> 35:19.270
I have instructed
the Ministry of Rites to set a date.

35:19.400 --> 35:20.480
The 15th, 10 days from now,

35:20.480 --> 35:21.960
is an auspicious date.

35:22.030 --> 35:23.870
The Prince of Zhennan and Xiyang

35:23.960 --> 35:25.420
will be married in 10 days.

35:25.480 --> 35:26.920
Ceremonial Officer, what do you think?

35:26.920 --> 35:29.650
Everything is at your discretion,
Your Majesty.

35:51.070 --> 35:51.730
Xiyang.

35:52.590 --> 35:53.790
Greetings, Brother.

35:58.070 --> 36:00.400
The weather is fine today with few clouds,

36:00.480 --> 36:02.190
perfect for flower viewing.

36:02.710 --> 36:04.840
I heard the betrothal gifts
from Jinxiu have arrived.

36:04.840 --> 36:06.320
Father has decreed that in 10 days,

36:06.320 --> 36:07.850
you will marry Xia Jingshi.

36:09.110 --> 36:09.910
What's wrong?

36:10.480 --> 36:11.510
Your wedding is approaching,

36:11.510 --> 36:13.310
yet you still think of seeing me?

36:14.230 --> 36:15.070
Brother,

36:15.760 --> 36:17.210
are you reproaching me?

36:18.070 --> 36:19.930
I was just making a casual remark.

36:20.510 --> 36:21.550
Can't I even make

36:21.550 --> 36:22.410
a joke anymore?

36:30.360 --> 36:31.590
Why are you so down?

36:32.360 --> 36:33.510
I don't know

36:34.230 --> 36:35.760
if I should tell you or not.

36:36.670 --> 36:37.630
As siblings,

36:37.630 --> 36:38.890
what can't you tell me?

36:40.960 --> 36:41.960
Since you've agreed

36:41.960 --> 36:43.710
for me to marry the Prince of Zhennan,

36:43.710 --> 36:45.150
I feel grateful.

36:45.760 --> 36:47.800
I shouldn't be the one to say this.

36:48.280 --> 36:49.480
I can't say it either,

36:49.840 --> 36:50.400
but still,

36:50.400 --> 36:51.510
I can't help wanting to know the truth.

36:51.510 --> 36:53.310
Brother, why are you doing this?

36:53.510 --> 36:54.360
Are you referring to

36:54.360 --> 36:56.220
making him marry into our family?

36:58.030 --> 37:00.060
He can stay with his family

37:00.150 --> 37:01.860
and marry the person he loves.

37:02.000 --> 37:03.550
Isn't that the best outcome?

37:03.550 --> 37:04.360
But after all,

37:04.400 --> 37:06.230
he is the Prince of Zhennan from Jinxiu.

37:06.230 --> 37:06.960
This marriage alliance

37:06.960 --> 37:09.220
is not only a matter between our kingdoms

37:09.320 --> 37:11.710
but also a blessed union
between him and me.

37:11.710 --> 37:13.110
I thought that in the days to come,

37:13.110 --> 37:13.800
I could be with him

37:13.800 --> 37:15.480
and see the vastness of the world,

37:15.480 --> 37:16.880
experience all aspects of life,

37:16.880 --> 37:18.590
and live freely and passionately.

37:18.590 --> 37:19.360
I never imagined

37:19.360 --> 37:21.690
he would be trapped in a cage
because of me.

37:22.110 --> 37:23.670
What do you want then?

37:23.920 --> 37:25.380
Give him back his freedom.

37:25.670 --> 37:27.280
Let me return to Jinxiu with him.

37:25.830 --> 37:29.140
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

37:31.320 --> 37:33.920
Do you realize what you're saying?

37:31.570 --> 37:35.890
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

37:36.550 --> 37:37.320
Brother.

37:38.880 --> 37:40.190
Do you know

37:40.660 --> 37:43.970
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

37:41.030 --> 37:42.710
how happy I was

37:43.400 --> 37:45.330
when you agreed to let me marry him?

37:46.190 --> 37:47.760
I thought you cared about me

37:46.690 --> 37:51.620
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

37:48.280 --> 37:49.340
and understood me.

37:50.320 --> 37:51.630
I thought that was why

37:52.280 --> 37:52.960
you agreed

37:53.000 --> 37:54.460
to let me marry your enemy.

37:56.280 --> 37:57.710
But I never expected

37:58.840 --> 37:59.960
that behind all this

37:59.960 --> 38:01.440
was your scheme.

38:03.000 --> 38:04.280
I am your sister.

38:04.920 --> 38:06.600
We have the same parents.

38:07.030 --> 38:08.190
How could you take advantage

38:08.190 --> 38:09.170
of even my wedding?

38:08.590 --> 38:10.390
♪ Flying alone ♪

38:09.800 --> 38:10.440
He's the one

38:10.440 --> 38:11.670
who will accompany me forever!

38:10.960 --> 38:13.370
♪ With no need for direction ♪

38:12.320 --> 38:12.920
In this world,

38:12.920 --> 38:14.230
he'll be the only one

38:14.280 --> 38:15.840
to remain by my side forever.

38:15.840 --> 38:17.320
How am I supposed to face him

38:16.160 --> 38:18.020
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

38:17.320 --> 38:18.610
and explain in the future?

38:18.610 --> 38:21.240
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

38:19.920 --> 38:20.630
Brother,

38:21.630 --> 38:22.630
you really

38:22.630 --> 38:23.920
disappointed me.

38:23.730 --> 38:25.450
♪ Roaming freely ♪

38:25.980 --> 38:29.220
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

38:31.620 --> 38:32.830
♪ The wet wings ♪

38:33.630 --> 38:37.220
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

38:38.600 --> 38:42.230
[Jingming Garden]

38:41.190 --> 38:42.250
Prince of Zhennan.

38:42.840 --> 38:44.570
According to our customs,

38:44.670 --> 38:45.850
you must

38:45.880 --> 38:47.070
stay in a separate residence

38:47.070 --> 38:48.590
before the wedding.

38:53.060 --> 38:55.100
[Jingming Garden]

38:59.190 --> 39:00.840
You six, guard the main entrance.

39:00.840 --> 39:01.470
Yes.

39:02.920 --> 39:04.230
You four, guard the back.

39:04.230 --> 39:04.880
Yes.

39:06.210 --> 39:09.910
[Jingming Garden]

39:07.190 --> 39:09.030
The rest of you,
patrol throughout the residence.

39:09.030 --> 39:09.630
Yes.

39:12.840 --> 39:14.960
His Majesty is concerned about

39:14.960 --> 39:16.400
you and the Princess's safety.

39:16.400 --> 39:19.360
He has specially assigned Imperial Guards
to protect you day and night.

39:19.360 --> 39:20.110
Prince of Zhennan,

39:20.110 --> 39:21.320
please make yourself

39:21.320 --> 39:22.320
comfortable and at ease

39:22.320 --> 39:23.510
in this residence.

39:24.480 --> 39:25.400
This...

39:32.710 --> 39:35.010
Prime Minister Zhuang also said

39:35.550 --> 39:38.250
you should not be troubled by this.

39:38.320 --> 39:39.920
The wedding is the priority.

39:40.000 --> 39:41.060
After the wedding,

39:41.110 --> 39:43.770
everything might change.

39:49.120 --> 39:52.340
[Jingming Garden]

39:55.710 --> 39:57.160
I am your sister.

39:57.960 --> 39:59.760
We have the same parents.

40:00.590 --> 40:01.670
How could you take advantage

40:01.670 --> 40:02.740
of even my wedding?

40:03.590 --> 40:05.710
He's the one who will
accompany me forever!

40:05.710 --> 40:06.400
In this world,

40:06.400 --> 40:07.840
he'll be the only one

40:07.840 --> 40:09.230
to remain by my side forever.

40:09.230 --> 40:10.760
How am I supposed to face him

40:10.760 --> 40:12.220
and explain in the future?

40:12.660 --> 40:13.480
Brother,

40:14.710 --> 40:15.670
you really

40:15.710 --> 40:17.070
disappointed me.

40:18.590 --> 40:19.450
Your Highness.

40:24.880 --> 40:25.590
What is it?

40:26.400 --> 40:27.550
Xia Jingshi has already moved into

40:27.550 --> 40:28.580
the royal villa.

40:28.880 --> 40:30.590
That guy would never have imagined

40:30.590 --> 40:31.400
that you would find a way

40:31.400 --> 40:32.430
to detain him in Susha.

40:32.430 --> 40:33.710
I bet even that old fox
Prime Minister Zhuang

40:33.710 --> 40:35.110
is completely helpless.

40:35.870 --> 40:38.270
Have you found the person
who tried to assassinate Yixiao?

40:38.270 --> 40:39.550
His identity has been confirmed.

40:39.550 --> 40:41.150
It's Lieutenant Xun Xiang
from the North Pass.

40:41.150 --> 40:42.150
By now, Xun Xiang should have

40:42.150 --> 40:43.920
already escaped from Yujing City.

40:43.920 --> 40:44.760
Don't worry.

40:44.840 --> 40:46.360
I've already sent people to capture him.

40:46.360 --> 40:47.360
He won't get away.

40:48.070 --> 40:48.930
Your Highness,

40:49.550 --> 40:51.190
I just can't figure this out.

40:51.550 --> 40:52.900
Why would Xun Xiang

40:53.030 --> 40:54.580
want to kill Miss Yixiao?

40:55.000 --> 40:56.050
It makes no sense.

40:56.110 --> 40:58.040
He was acting on someone's orders.

40:58.150 --> 40:59.210
Years ago, the Xun family

40:59.210 --> 41:01.000
received favors from Empress Zhuang.

41:01.000 --> 41:02.440
This matter is likely connected

41:02.440 --> 41:03.640
to the Zhuang family.

41:04.630 --> 41:06.450
So the Empress sent someone

41:06.630 --> 41:07.760
to kill Miss Yixiao?

41:09.000 --> 41:10.530
For Prime Minister Zhuang?

41:11.150 --> 41:14.030
Prime Minister Zhuang
instructed the Empress to do this?

41:14.030 --> 41:15.880
For now, we don't need to
ask so many questions.

41:15.880 --> 41:18.360
Once we catch Xun Xiang,
everything will be clear.

41:18.360 --> 41:19.360
We need him alive.

41:19.630 --> 41:20.400
Understood.

41:25.710 --> 41:27.510
The marriage alliance
is already finalized.

41:27.510 --> 41:29.840
Why did you take such unnecessary action?

41:31.190 --> 41:32.360
I'm just removing obstacles

41:32.360 --> 41:33.690
for Xiyang, that's all.

41:34.440 --> 41:35.760
That female general from Jinxiu

41:35.760 --> 41:37.670
went through life and death
with Xia Jingshi.

41:37.670 --> 41:39.710
They've probably already
fallen for each other.

41:39.710 --> 41:41.380
She's just a female general.

41:42.070 --> 41:43.440
Are you saying Xia Jingshi

41:43.440 --> 41:45.500
won't have concubines in the future?

41:47.150 --> 41:48.390
But in my opinion,

41:48.510 --> 41:49.710
if that woman isn't eliminated,

41:49.710 --> 41:51.590
she'll eventually become a threat.

41:51.590 --> 41:53.320
She's in Yujing City right now.

41:53.590 --> 41:54.630
How could I miss

41:54.650 --> 41:55.710
this opportunity?

41:55.840 --> 41:57.070
You acted rashly.

41:57.230 --> 41:59.030
If Feng Suige notices anything,

41:59.400 --> 42:01.110
the blame will fall on me.

42:01.800 --> 42:03.510
Father, you needn't worry.

42:03.880 --> 42:04.510
That Xun Xiang

42:04.510 --> 42:06.320
comes from the 17th Battalion
of lower ranks.

42:06.320 --> 42:08.310
Nobody pays any attention to him.

42:08.880 --> 42:09.730
He won't be connected

42:09.730 --> 42:11.030
to you in any way.

42:11.360 --> 42:12.230
Anything you do

42:12.230 --> 42:13.560
will be connected to me.

42:14.440 --> 42:15.580
Drop this matter.

42:16.150 --> 42:17.480
Don't act rashly again.

42:30.440 --> 42:31.580
Let me remind you.

42:32.110 --> 42:34.320
If you don't want to be
trapped here forever,

42:34.320 --> 42:35.630
then stay calm

42:35.880 --> 42:37.230
and don't act rashly.

42:46.550 --> 42:47.410
Your Highness,

42:47.670 --> 42:49.070
Princess Xiyang is here.

42:51.190 --> 42:51.920
Got it.
